OL,3,GNEWSAFury vs Joshua fight to go ahead
OL,4,Adespite objections over 3am finish
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have approved plans
OL,7,Fallowing December's highly anticipated
OL,8,FTyson Fury v Anthony Joshua fight in
OL,9,FCardiff to finish in the early hours.
OL,11,FFans in hospitality boxes at the
OL,12,FPrincipality Stadium will be allowed to
OL,13,Fdrink alcohol until 03:00, with the
OL,14,Fvenue closing at 03:30, to align with
OL,15,Fprime time viewing in the US.
OL,17,FMembers of Cardiff Council's Licensing
OL,18,FSub Committee were told 130 police
OL,19,Fofficers would help maintain order at
OL,20,Fthe event on 11 December, with twice
OL,21,Fthe number of stewards present compared
OL,22,Fto a regular sports event.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
